Find assassins  in the crowd, protect your allies before others manage to kill them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But this isn't just a game about offense! Defense is equally crucial. You must be aware of your surroundings and closely observe other feast-goers. Is one of them acting suspiciously? It could be an enemy assassin targeting your king or one of your allies! Quickly identify the threat and protect your ruler before others manage to kill him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873340/extras/d2de903616103da1f3d45c507d1faf32.poster.avif?t=1753908890\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873340/extras/d2de903616103da1f3d45c507d1faf32.webm?t=1753908890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873340/extras/d2de903616103da1f3d45c507d1faf32.mp4?t=1753908890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Kings Gambit&quot; is a strategic action game where the ability to hide, cunning planning, and quick reactions are key to victory. Take part in a royal feast as an undercover assassin! Your goal is to kill the enemy king and secure the throne for your ruler. But watch out! There are enemy assassins who would like to eliminate you and your king. Blend into the crowd and find a way to reach your goal! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you manage to remain undetected and secure victory for your team?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cla